WEBVTT

01:32.041 --> 01:37.359
[Flourished Peony]

01:37.359 --> 01:40.168
[Episode 31]

01:40.680 --> 01:42.879
I hear the bride is gorgeous.

01:42.879 --> 01:44.040
Mr. Liu, please.

01:44.040 --> 01:45.352
- Okay.
- Okay.

01:50.760 --> 01:52.840
Mr. Jiang is such an amorous man.

01:52.840 --> 01:55.079
He took two concubines in three days.

01:55.079 --> 01:57.480
I hear his first concubine is low-status.

01:57.480 --> 01:59.239
Mr. Jiang didn't give her a wedding.

01:59.799 --> 02:02.879
Today, His Highness
gave Mr. Jiang a noble concubine.

02:02.879 --> 02:05.680
This banquet is luxurious.

02:08.159 --> 02:09.840
Chuanyu.

02:09.840 --> 02:11.919
Why haven't the bride and groom come?

02:11.919 --> 02:13.439
We can't wait to give our congratulations.

02:13.439 --> 02:14.479
Indeed.

02:14.479 --> 02:15.800
They will be here soon.

02:15.800 --> 02:17.439
I'll go and check on them.

02:17.439 --> 02:18.728
Come on.

02:47.759 --> 02:50.240
Haven't you been ready yet?

02:50.240 --> 02:52.840
Taking a concubine is not serious--

02:52.840 --> 02:55.479
I guess you don't take me seriously.

02:56.520 --> 02:58.240
No wedding carriage.

02:58.240 --> 02:59.560
No poetry for me.

03:00.240 --> 03:01.919
I've already compromised.

03:02.719 --> 03:03.719
Moreover,

03:03.719 --> 03:04.919
Mudan

03:05.439 --> 03:06.719
hasn't come back yet.

03:09.400 --> 03:11.039
She has business to attend to.

03:11.039 --> 03:12.439
She may not make it in time.

03:13.479 --> 03:14.840
If you want to see her,

03:14.840 --> 03:16.400
you'll see her tomorrow when greeting her.

03:24.960 --> 03:26.919
I never forget His Highness's instruction.

03:27.560 --> 03:29.199
At tonight's wedding banquet,

03:29.199 --> 03:30.759
I must drink with Mudan.

03:31.599 --> 03:33.479
Mudan won't neglect Prince Ning

03:34.280 --> 03:35.360
and refuse me,

03:36.120 --> 03:37.352
right?

03:39.400 --> 03:40.800
I side with His Highness.

03:40.800 --> 03:42.439
Mudan sides with me.

03:42.439 --> 03:43.688
She won't refuse you.

03:44.719 --> 03:46.400
How about you stay

03:46.400 --> 03:47.639
and choose headwear for me?

03:53.400 --> 03:55.479
Mudan has finally returned.

03:56.080 --> 03:57.240
I will go and warn her

03:57.240 --> 03:58.639
not to miss your auspicious time.

04:07.840 --> 04:09.439
- Not bad.
- Smells so good.

04:10.439 --> 04:12.080
I've told you so much.
How can you not understand?

04:12.080 --> 04:13.199
This tastes good.

04:13.199 --> 04:14.520
You've married him for only three days.

04:14.520 --> 04:15.800
Today, he took another concubine

04:15.800 --> 04:17.319
without even telling you in advance.

04:19.439 --> 04:20.639
Tell me.

04:20.639 --> 04:21.720
What are you going to do with him?

04:23.360 --> 04:24.800
He is my husband, and I'm his concubine.

04:24.800 --> 04:27.319
He doesn't need to inform me
about taking a new concubine.

04:27.319 --> 04:28.480
- Come on.
- Alright.

04:29.639 --> 04:30.984
Delicious.

04:32.639 --> 04:33.928
Let's go.

04:34.759 --> 04:36.199
He's not important.

04:36.199 --> 04:38.399
Our opening feast matters more.

04:38.399 --> 04:39.759
- Come on.
- Do you want more?

04:39.759 --> 04:41.360
- Drink less.
- This wasn't grilled by Lady He.

04:41.360 --> 04:42.759
It's so unpalatable.

04:43.399 --> 04:44.439
This is burnt.

04:44.439 --> 04:46.079
No worries, I'll grill more

04:46.079 --> 04:47.160
for you.

04:48.439 --> 04:49.600
- Come on.
- You eat this.

04:49.600 --> 04:50.920
There's alcohol left.

04:50.920 --> 04:51.959
Everyone, drink up.

04:51.959 --> 04:53.040
- Thank you.
- Come on.

04:56.600 --> 04:57.960
Okay.

04:58.680 --> 04:59.920
Guys.

04:59.920 --> 05:02.079
From now on,
Fragrance Garden relies on you all.

05:02.079 --> 05:04.000
Please work hard.

05:04.000 --> 05:05.720
When our business thrives,

05:05.720 --> 05:06.879
at the celebration banquet,

05:06.879 --> 05:08.480
I'll prepare even better alcohol for you.

05:08.480 --> 05:10.000
Let's drink.

05:11.360 --> 05:13.360
Lady He is righteous.

05:13.360 --> 05:15.480
We're very lucky to work for you.

05:15.480 --> 05:16.480
We must work hard

05:16.480 --> 05:17.839
to run the Fragrance Garden soon.

05:18.480 --> 05:19.480
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

05:20.360 --> 05:21.480
Drink!

05:25.288 --> 05:26.480
- Help yourselves.
- Come on.

05:26.480 --> 05:28.439
- Fill it for me.
- Drink.

05:29.319 --> 05:30.720
This one is burnt.

05:30.720 --> 05:32.279
Don't eat it. Just throw it away.

05:43.279 --> 05:45.399
- You eat.
- Give it a try.

05:45.399 --> 05:46.680
Give me more.

05:46.680 --> 05:48.120
Here you are.

05:48.120 --> 05:49.399
Anyone else want more drinks?

05:49.399 --> 05:50.920
I don't want any more.

05:50.920 --> 05:52.279
Help me entertain everyone.

05:52.279 --> 05:53.279
I'll be right back.

05:53.279 --> 05:54.920
Okay.

05:54.920 --> 05:56.279
Come on.

05:56.279 --> 05:58.399
- Look at you.
- Give it to me.

06:09.839 --> 06:10.984
Jiang Changyang.

06:18.839 --> 06:21.480
You're taking another concubine again.

06:21.480 --> 06:23.560
What are you doing here?

06:24.959 --> 06:26.800
You burned some meat

06:26.800 --> 06:28.104
just now.

06:29.959 --> 06:31.120
I thought

06:31.120 --> 06:32.600
I couldn't always
eat your night snack for free.

06:32.600 --> 06:33.839
So I wanted to repay you.

06:34.519 --> 06:35.600
What happened?

06:35.600 --> 06:36.600
You kept me waiting.

06:37.240 --> 06:38.879
As soon as you returned, you started

06:38.879 --> 06:39.920
to drink with those people.

06:42.199 --> 06:44.279
I got capable workers.

06:44.279 --> 06:46.040
So I'm holding a feast for that.

06:47.639 --> 06:48.680
Mr. Jiang.

06:49.319 --> 06:50.759
You're taking a new concubine.

06:50.759 --> 06:52.160
On your wedding day,

06:52.160 --> 06:54.199
you still have time to drink with me?

06:55.480 --> 06:57.040
Do you think I want to take a concubine?

06:58.959 --> 07:00.040
Prince Ning likes to use women

07:00.040 --> 07:02.199
to buy people off and control the officials.

07:02.199 --> 07:04.399
He even placed Consort Hui at His Majesty.

07:04.399 --> 07:06.600
What else can I do to refuse him?

07:09.560 --> 07:11.360
Previously, you had no wife or concubines.

07:12.240 --> 07:14.199
So he couldn't plant anyone around you.

07:14.879 --> 07:16.360
However,

07:16.360 --> 07:17.959
now that I'm your first concubine,

07:18.480 --> 07:19.800
you can't refuse another concubine.

07:21.639 --> 07:22.888
So,

07:23.759 --> 07:25.160
I owe you an apology.

07:28.480 --> 07:29.600
It's good that you're considerate.

07:33.720 --> 07:35.079
The concubine sent by Prince Ning

07:35.079 --> 07:36.519
is not easy to deal with.

07:36.519 --> 07:38.680
She has chosen hairpins for a long time.

07:38.680 --> 07:40.079
She's waiting for you

07:40.079 --> 07:41.160
to offer you a few drinks.

07:43.399 --> 07:45.720
Since I'm partly responsible,

07:45.720 --> 07:47.120
no matter how difficult she is,

07:47.120 --> 07:48.680
I will help you deal with her.

07:49.319 --> 07:50.472
Let's go.

07:52.639 --> 07:54.120
You're already drunk.

07:54.720 --> 07:55.800
If you show up like this,

07:55.800 --> 07:56.800
it'll be inappropriate,

07:56.800 --> 07:58.024
and you'll be a joke.

08:04.160 --> 08:05.680
You drank a bit too much.

08:07.399 --> 08:09.560
Your face is red.

08:09.560 --> 08:10.959
The powder can't even cover it.

08:30.000 --> 08:34.720
The bride and groom are coming.

08:50.279 --> 08:52.440
Men love beautiful women.

08:52.440 --> 08:54.200
Look, what a pretty concubine.

08:54.200 --> 08:56.039
Even her makeup is so good.

08:56.639 --> 08:58.440
Lady He surprised me.

08:59.000 --> 09:00.120
She provided beautiful flowers

09:00.799 --> 09:02.120
and good makeup stuff

09:02.120 --> 09:03.279
and rouge

09:07.200 --> 09:08.919
Yes, very beautiful.

09:17.080 --> 09:18.639
You must be Lianzhou.

09:20.000 --> 09:22.399
I hear that you would like to toast me.

09:22.399 --> 09:24.000
I was delayed on the way here.

09:24.000 --> 09:25.360
Please forgive me.

09:27.399 --> 09:28.919
Mudan.

09:28.919 --> 09:30.080
Nice to meet you.

09:42.919 --> 09:44.480
From now on, we are family.

09:44.480 --> 09:46.679
If there's anything you need,

09:46.679 --> 09:47.976
feel free to tell me.

09:48.960 --> 09:50.639
You really treat me as family?

09:51.240 --> 09:52.600
Then why are you late?

09:53.519 --> 09:55.480
I thought you didn't want to see me

09:55.480 --> 09:57.200
to disgrace His Highness.

09:57.759 --> 09:59.279
How could that be?

09:59.279 --> 10:01.879
As soon as you arrived, I sent word to Mudan.

10:01.879 --> 10:03.279
To celebrate our wedding,

10:03.279 --> 10:04.919
she prepared fine alcohol for us.

10:05.480 --> 10:07.480
She respects you
as His Highness's adopted daughter.

10:07.480 --> 10:08.639
It took a while to choose alcohol for you.

10:08.639 --> 10:10.024
That's why she's late.

10:10.024 --> 10:11.144
Yes.

10:12.000 --> 10:13.288
Come.

10:19.200 --> 10:21.320
I've been renovating Fragrance Garden.

10:21.320 --> 10:22.320
The alcohol maker

10:22.320 --> 10:24.000
brewed this Flowers Wine.

10:24.720 --> 10:26.799
This wine tastes smooth and rich

10:26.799 --> 10:28.360
with a lingering fragrance.

10:28.360 --> 10:31.240
I wanted to open it next spring.

10:31.240 --> 10:33.120
But since it's a wedding day,

10:33.120 --> 10:35.320
I'll take this opportunity

10:35.320 --> 10:36.679
to share the wine

10:36.679 --> 10:37.679
with you all.

10:38.360 --> 10:39.559
Good.

10:42.039 --> 10:43.720
Good wine.

10:45.120 --> 10:46.480
It's really good.

10:46.480 --> 10:47.592
Here you are.

10:49.399 --> 10:50.759
Indeed, it is good wine.

10:53.200 --> 10:55.759
This wine is mellow and fragrant.

10:55.759 --> 10:57.159
If I can

10:57.159 --> 10:58.840
buy some of this wine,

10:58.840 --> 11:00.480
- that would be great.
- Yes.

11:00.480 --> 11:01.480
This wine is good.

11:01.480 --> 11:03.200
Lady He's makeup is even better.

11:03.200 --> 11:04.840
What's your makeup called?

11:05.879 --> 11:07.200
Drunken Rosy.

11:07.200 --> 11:09.720
It was done by Huamanzhu's Rosy Rouge.

11:09.720 --> 11:11.080
And this Flowers Wine

11:11.080 --> 11:12.799
is only available for sale at Fragrance Garden.

11:12.799 --> 11:14.000
I hope

11:14.000 --> 11:16.279
- all of you will come.
- Alright.

11:16.279 --> 11:17.519
Indeed, it's good wine.

11:17.519 --> 11:19.000
I'll order ten jars of it.

11:19.000 --> 11:20.039
Great.

11:20.039 --> 11:21.360
I'm happy to be here today.

11:21.360 --> 11:22.519
Me too.

11:25.000 --> 11:27.120
I'm a busy businesswoman,

11:27.120 --> 11:28.480
not a refined woman.

11:28.480 --> 11:29.840
I hope you don't mind.

11:30.960 --> 11:32.080
I think

11:32.080 --> 11:33.559
you're thoughtful.

11:33.559 --> 11:35.639
I'll leave the domestic chores

11:35.639 --> 11:36.799
to you.

11:38.039 --> 11:40.320
Alright, I've given the wine as a gift.

11:40.320 --> 11:41.360
And we've seen each other.

11:41.360 --> 11:42.360
I hope

11:42.360 --> 11:43.399
you'll enjoy your wedding.

12:03.799 --> 12:05.039
Madam.

12:05.039 --> 12:06.240
The guests have left.

12:06.240 --> 12:08.120
But I can't find Mr. Jiang.

12:08.120 --> 12:10.399
He must have gone to Lady He's room.

12:14.440 --> 12:16.039
His Highness sent me here

12:16.039 --> 12:17.639
to win over Jiang Changyang

12:18.240 --> 12:19.360
so that in the future

12:20.039 --> 12:21.919
he will work for His Highness.

12:24.080 --> 12:25.200
Tonight,

12:26.080 --> 12:27.519
I can't just wait here for nothing.

12:37.639 --> 12:38.879
It's been a long day.

12:38.879 --> 12:40.200
You still have to act with me tonight.

12:41.039 --> 12:42.120
Sorry about that.

12:42.879 --> 12:44.200
Without me,

12:44.200 --> 12:46.639
you wouldn't have to act at all.

12:59.559 --> 13:00.648
What's wrong?

13:02.799 --> 13:04.279
Nothing.

13:04.279 --> 13:05.320
Lianzhou

13:05.320 --> 13:06.360
has married you.

13:06.919 --> 13:08.399
Yet she's watched out for.

13:09.240 --> 13:10.799
I had similar experiences

13:10.799 --> 13:11.960
when I

13:13.200 --> 13:14.360
married Liu Chang.

13:15.919 --> 13:17.240
She is quite pitiful.

13:18.919 --> 13:19.919
Just now at the banquet,

13:20.879 --> 13:23.000
she was aggressive and tried to embarrass you.

13:23.000 --> 13:24.639
Yet you were always nice.

13:24.639 --> 13:26.039
So I realized

13:26.039 --> 13:27.320
you had pity for her.

13:29.159 --> 13:30.240
She is sent by Prince Ning

13:30.240 --> 13:32.000
as a pawn to gain your favor.

13:32.000 --> 13:33.440
I guess she can't

13:33.440 --> 13:34.639
choose what to do herself.

13:37.519 --> 13:38.879
Since Shengyi died,

13:39.960 --> 13:41.159
I've figured out one thing.

13:41.799 --> 13:43.440
All women have the same fate.

13:44.720 --> 13:45.840
Anyway,

13:45.840 --> 13:47.360
I'll do my best to avoid her.

13:48.360 --> 13:50.759
If she harbors no malice,

13:50.759 --> 13:52.639
don't be too harsh on her.

13:54.679 --> 13:56.440
Got it.

13:56.440 --> 13:57.960
Since you pity her,

13:57.960 --> 13:59.840
how about you spend tonight with her?

13:59.840 --> 14:01.320
Then I don't have to pretend anymore.

14:07.279 --> 14:08.879
Why hasn't she come yet?

14:09.559 --> 14:11.080
Could it be that we've misunderstood her?

14:11.759 --> 14:14.320
Perhaps she doesn't want to marry

14:14.320 --> 14:15.480
like me.

14:19.559 --> 14:20.936
Here she comes.

14:25.799 --> 14:28.320
Five black pieces.

14:28.320 --> 14:29.799
I won.

14:29.799 --> 14:31.039
A bet is a bet.

14:31.559 --> 14:32.639
You take a piece of clothing.

14:33.440 --> 14:34.480
Alright.

14:35.120 --> 14:36.360
Darling.

14:37.879 --> 14:39.240
Lianzhou.

14:39.240 --> 14:40.679
What brings you here?

14:40.679 --> 14:42.200
I've been looking for you, darling.

14:42.200 --> 14:44.000
It's our wedding day.

14:44.000 --> 14:45.440
We should spend tonight together.

14:45.440 --> 14:47.279
I can't trouble Mudan to attend to you.

14:49.000 --> 14:50.360
Darling, you're drunk.

14:51.039 --> 14:52.559
Allow me to attend to you.

14:53.639 --> 14:54.879
Go back to my room and rest.

14:54.879 --> 14:56.600
I am not drunk.

14:56.600 --> 14:59.440
I want to play a game with Mudan.

14:59.440 --> 15:02.360
Tonight, I must beat you.

15:03.400 --> 15:04.480
It's my turn now.

15:04.480 --> 15:05.960
It's my turn. You just did it.

15:05.960 --> 15:08.840
It's my turn. You watch.

15:08.840 --> 15:10.559
Since you like it,

15:10.559 --> 15:11.639
I will join you.

15:11.639 --> 15:13.279
It'll be more interesting.

15:13.279 --> 15:14.559
You know what?

15:15.440 --> 15:18.080
I'm good at this game.

15:20.120 --> 15:21.480
Alright.

15:21.480 --> 15:23.879
So good.

15:23.879 --> 15:25.600
Come on. Let's drink.

15:27.399 --> 15:28.600
Lianzhou, are you all right?

15:28.600 --> 15:30.799
Darling, you're drunk.

15:30.799 --> 15:32.240
- Are you all right?
- What a dampener.

15:33.440 --> 15:35.600
- He is going to vomit.
- Get me the spittoon.

15:35.600 --> 15:36.879
I'm going to vomit.

15:36.879 --> 15:38.600
Darling, come to bed.

15:38.600 --> 15:40.440
Lianzhou, he's drunk.

15:40.440 --> 15:42.399
You can't move him.

15:42.399 --> 15:43.879
Be careful, this way.

15:43.879 --> 15:45.279
This way. I can do it.

15:45.279 --> 15:47.759
Leave it to me. Slow down.

15:47.759 --> 15:49.240
I'm not drunk.

15:49.240 --> 15:50.320
You lie down.

15:50.320 --> 15:51.440
I'll be right back.

15:51.440 --> 15:52.720
Mudan.

15:52.720 --> 15:55.000
Even if you take care of him,

15:55.000 --> 15:57.279
he can't do anything tonight.

15:57.279 --> 15:59.399
Go back and get some rest.

16:00.039 --> 16:01.360
When he's drunk, he hits people.

16:01.360 --> 16:02.879
Come on. I'll look after him.

16:02.879 --> 16:04.159
Come on.

16:04.159 --> 16:05.759
Play with me.

16:05.759 --> 16:07.279
- Mudan.
- I'm coming.

16:08.399 --> 16:09.544
I'm coming.

16:10.559 --> 16:13.279
Chess. Let's play.

16:14.480 --> 16:17.200
Mr. Jiang ignores you on the first day.

16:17.200 --> 16:19.120
What should we do?

16:20.879 --> 16:22.120
No worries.

16:22.120 --> 16:24.799
I have seen plenty of such dudes.

16:24.799 --> 16:26.240
They always

16:26.240 --> 16:27.679
have new women.

16:27.679 --> 16:28.879
It's very normal for them.

16:29.720 --> 16:31.440
Sooner or later he will tire of He Weifang.

16:33.159 --> 16:34.639
Mr. Jiang

16:34.639 --> 16:37.200
never belongs to one woman.

16:38.159 --> 16:39.559
I'll gain a foothold

16:40.240 --> 16:42.039
in this house after having a child.

16:43.480 --> 16:44.600
Then, I can whisper anything

16:44.600 --> 16:46.000
to Mr. Jiang during pillow talk

16:46.639 --> 16:48.600
and get wealth

16:49.440 --> 16:50.480
from him.

16:52.120 --> 16:54.039
Compared to the short love of a man,

16:55.759 --> 16:56.919
gold, silver, and property

16:56.919 --> 16:58.080
make me feel secure.

16:59.320 --> 17:00.840
Am I right?

17:00.840 --> 17:02.000
Yes, you are.

17:25.559 --> 17:27.160
She has left.

17:27.160 --> 17:28.920
Not so soon.

17:28.920 --> 17:31.319
Be careful not to alert her. Wait a bit longer.

17:37.640 --> 17:38.960
I have something to ask you.

17:41.319 --> 17:43.279
You have stuff to be moved
to the Fragrance Garden.

17:44.920 --> 17:46.000
When will you do it?

17:48.240 --> 17:49.512
Tomorrow.

17:57.799 --> 17:59.240
I know what you're thinking.

18:00.920 --> 18:02.160
Are you afraid

18:03.640 --> 18:04.759
I will default on my debts and flee?

18:07.119 --> 18:08.519
Rest assured,

18:08.519 --> 18:10.440
I am not an ingrate.

18:10.440 --> 18:12.200
I won't default on my debts.

18:14.279 --> 18:15.528
She's left.

18:21.160 --> 18:22.799
You saved me.

18:22.799 --> 18:24.599
A single jar of Peach Blossom

18:24.599 --> 18:25.720
is far from enough to repay you.

18:26.680 --> 18:28.400
Though I know you lack nothing,

18:28.400 --> 18:30.119
I still need to show my sincerity.

18:31.480 --> 18:33.599
You have 20 percent of the revenue

18:33.599 --> 18:34.839
from the Fragrance Garden.

18:34.839 --> 18:37.039
This is the contract.

18:37.039 --> 18:38.056
Take a look.

18:42.906 --> 18:45.579
[Contract]

18:54.160 --> 18:56.079
You're being so generous for the first time.

18:57.680 --> 18:58.720
I'm not even used to it.

19:01.880 --> 19:03.720
After all, my life is worth a fortune.

19:04.759 --> 19:06.480
I have your protection now.

19:06.480 --> 19:07.519
In fact,

19:07.519 --> 19:08.640
I am the one who gets benefits.

19:10.920 --> 19:12.160
Fragrance Garden is lent out

19:12.160 --> 19:13.880
for the nobles to hold a feast and have fun.

19:14.599 --> 19:15.799
You'll surely make a fortune.

19:16.480 --> 19:18.880
This business is highly profitable.

19:18.880 --> 19:20.440
Very good.

19:20.440 --> 19:22.759
I won't do business only with the wealthy.

19:23.680 --> 19:25.000
Either the common people

19:25.519 --> 19:27.319
or the nobility

19:27.319 --> 19:29.720
can enjoy the flowers, listen to music,

19:30.319 --> 19:32.400
and drink wine

19:32.400 --> 19:33.559
as long as they pay the entrance fee.

19:34.240 --> 19:35.319
In Fragrance Garden,

19:35.319 --> 19:36.920
anyone can

19:36.920 --> 19:38.519
enjoy elegant and romantic pleasures.

19:43.480 --> 19:44.776
What's wrong?

20:15.359 --> 20:16.720
The Map of Fragrance Garden?

20:20.319 --> 20:22.880
[The Map of Fragrance Garden]
The gallery and pavilion are well arranged.

20:24.319 --> 20:26.440
The rockeries and flower clusters

20:26.440 --> 20:27.440
are also good.

20:28.480 --> 20:29.640
Where did you

20:29.640 --> 20:30.640
get this?

20:31.279 --> 20:32.400
The Superintendent of Works

20:32.400 --> 20:34.119
owes me a favor.

20:34.720 --> 20:35.880
He knows that we are newlyweds

20:35.880 --> 20:36.920
and you've acquired Fragrance Garden.

20:37.759 --> 20:39.359
So he redesigned the garden map

20:39.359 --> 20:40.920
and sent me a copy.

20:41.799 --> 20:43.000
Do you like it?

20:43.640 --> 20:44.799
If you don't,

20:44.799 --> 20:45.839
just throw it away.

20:45.839 --> 20:47.720
Of course, I like it.

20:48.599 --> 20:50.319
I'm so lucky to be friends

20:50.319 --> 20:51.759
with you.

20:51.759 --> 20:52.759
Thanks.

20:52.759 --> 20:54.319
You just realized?

20:54.319 --> 20:56.319
Many people are looking to befriend me.

20:56.319 --> 20:57.839
But I don't like them.

20:57.839 --> 20:59.000
You must cherish your chance.

21:04.799 --> 21:06.559
Yes, sure.

21:12.240 --> 21:13.279
I'll return to my room.

21:13.279 --> 21:14.920
Good night.

21:16.279 --> 21:18.200
All right, good night.

21:37.039 --> 21:38.152
Jiang Changyang.

21:39.359 --> 21:40.520
Thanks again.

22:03.480 --> 22:04.880
- Here.
- I want two boxes of Rosy Rouge.

22:04.880 --> 22:06.960
Sorry about that.

22:06.960 --> 22:09.079
- The last two boxes.
- Sold out.

22:09.079 --> 22:10.160
Everyone, please wait for the new stock.

22:10.160 --> 22:11.640
My apologies, sold out.

22:15.119 --> 22:16.480
Listen, here's the thing.

22:16.480 --> 22:18.839
We are preparing the Fragrance Garden.

22:18.839 --> 22:20.960
It will open next spring.

22:20.960 --> 22:22.440
The Rosy Rouge will be available.

22:22.440 --> 22:24.039
And we'll show various makeup.

22:24.039 --> 22:27.200
We will arrange for skilled ladies
to try makeup on you.

22:27.200 --> 22:29.119
- Try makeup on us?
- Yeah.

22:29.119 --> 22:30.759
I have to wait that long.

22:30.759 --> 22:32.160
The long-waiting guests

22:32.160 --> 22:34.440
have benefits others don't.

22:34.440 --> 22:35.839
At first, only 100 tickets

22:35.839 --> 22:37.039
are for sale

22:37.039 --> 22:38.400
at half price.

22:38.400 --> 22:40.240
First come, first served.

22:40.240 --> 22:42.680
- That's great.
- I want one.

22:42.680 --> 22:44.119
You can watch flowers,

22:44.119 --> 22:46.759
enjoy banquets, listen to music,

22:46.759 --> 22:48.480
and learn to do makeup,

22:48.480 --> 22:50.160
new makeup looks.

22:50.160 --> 22:52.359
I bet you'll be

22:52.359 --> 22:54.720
as beautiful as spring flowers.

22:55.799 --> 22:56.920
So good.

22:56.920 --> 22:58.920
We'll prepare Flowers Wine for everyone

22:58.920 --> 23:00.640
to drink while you tour the garden.

23:00.640 --> 23:03.279
You can take it home
and share it with your family.

23:03.279 --> 23:04.680
I want two tickets.

23:04.680 --> 23:05.839
- I want two.
- Me too.

23:05.839 --> 23:08.759
Everyone, please go to the opposite side.

23:08.759 --> 23:10.599
- Slow down.
- Take it easy.

23:10.599 --> 23:12.480
It's available for all of you. No rush.

23:12.480 --> 23:13.680
Buy tickets here.

23:14.240 --> 23:15.160
- I want one.
- I want one.

23:15.160 --> 23:16.440
- Line up!
- I want two tickets.

23:16.440 --> 23:17.960
Line up, please.

23:18.759 --> 23:20.400
Line up, please.

23:20.400 --> 23:22.119
I want five tickets.

23:22.119 --> 23:23.839
Previously,
due to the County Princess's influence,

23:23.839 --> 23:26.319
these noble ladies didn't dare to come.

23:26.319 --> 23:28.559
Finally, we've gone through a crisis.

23:29.240 --> 23:30.319
Sure.

23:30.319 --> 23:31.920
You and Chun manage the shop well.

23:31.920 --> 23:33.880
Consort Shu's condition has got better.

23:33.880 --> 23:36.359
Huamanzhu has long become famous.

23:37.039 --> 23:39.680
Plus, our shop always has new stock and makeup.

23:39.680 --> 23:41.839
Those noble ladies are very interested.

23:43.039 --> 23:44.079
They know

23:44.079 --> 23:45.559
you're close to Consort Shu.

23:45.559 --> 23:47.519
So they don't have to
flatter the County Princess.

23:47.519 --> 23:48.960
After all, the County Princess

23:48.960 --> 23:50.279
can't be openly against Consort Shu, right?

23:51.640 --> 23:54.880
If the County Princess hadn't forced me
to go to the polo field,

23:54.880 --> 23:56.480
I wouldn't have met Consort Shu.

23:56.480 --> 23:58.680
It's a happy surprise.

24:03.240 --> 24:04.359
Madam, I want three tickets.

24:04.359 --> 24:05.359
Here are you.

24:09.759 --> 24:11.000
I'm happy to be your neighbor.

24:11.000 --> 24:12.880
You've left for your ambition.

24:13.680 --> 24:14.920
I hope you'll take care

24:14.920 --> 24:16.319
and think of your old home

24:16.319 --> 24:17.400
now and again.

24:28.064 --> 24:37.288
[Jiang Changyang]

24:42.847 --> 24:45.192
[To Mudan]

24:56.279 --> 24:57.799
You've been gone for a long time.

24:57.799 --> 24:59.000
Why did you suddenly appear?

25:10.160 --> 25:11.960
Mudan thought

25:11.960 --> 25:13.160
about when you would come back.

25:13.799 --> 25:15.519
She has prepared dried fish for you

25:15.519 --> 25:17.032
in case you go hungry.

25:22.640 --> 25:24.039
My lord.

25:24.039 --> 25:25.759
Lady He hasn't returned.

25:26.960 --> 25:28.640
She has sent someone

25:28.640 --> 25:29.839
to move out her stuff.

25:33.920 --> 25:35.200
She is renovating the garden

25:35.799 --> 25:37.039
and needs to decorate it with rocks.

25:37.920 --> 25:39.119
I found her a piece

25:39.119 --> 25:40.359
of good stone as tall as a person.

25:40.880 --> 25:42.000
It will be delivered later.

25:47.240 --> 25:48.640
Tomorrow,

25:48.640 --> 25:49.799
you send this letter to Fragrance Garden

25:50.920 --> 25:52.279
together with that stone

25:52.799 --> 25:55.279
as my gift to her.

25:55.799 --> 25:56.808
Yes.

25:59.200 --> 26:00.559
My lord.

26:00.559 --> 26:01.640
Since you don't want her to leave,

26:01.640 --> 26:03.079
why not ask her to stay?

26:04.440 --> 26:05.440
A cat

26:05.440 --> 26:07.039
longs for freedom.

26:08.599 --> 26:11.240
Then what reason do I have to keep Mudan?

26:12.839 --> 26:13.920
But you've never been

26:13.920 --> 26:15.160
so attached to anyone else.

27:26.000 --> 27:27.240
How come you came back?

27:29.200 --> 27:31.400
After I decided on the flowers
to plant in the Fragrance Garden,

27:32.039 --> 27:33.359
I came back.

27:33.359 --> 27:34.664
Where should I go?

27:35.759 --> 27:37.359
I thought you were moving
to the Fragrance Garden.

27:37.960 --> 27:39.279
This house is almost emptied out.

27:41.799 --> 27:44.079
Fu has moved there to manage the garden.

27:44.079 --> 27:45.240
I'll stay here.

27:46.640 --> 27:48.599
I just planted new begonias.

27:49.119 --> 27:50.440
I promised you

27:50.440 --> 27:52.359
to make your backyard full of flowers.

27:53.920 --> 27:56.400
What? Am I bothering you?

27:56.400 --> 27:57.400
No.

27:57.400 --> 27:59.000
Mr. Jiang doesn't want you--

27:59.000 --> 28:01.200
I don't want to lose a money spinner.

28:04.799 --> 28:06.240
Fu advised me

28:06.240 --> 28:07.559
to move over with her.

28:08.799 --> 28:10.079
I thought about it.

28:10.079 --> 28:11.240
However…

28:14.279 --> 28:16.559
We're faking a marriage.

28:16.559 --> 28:17.680
If I leave you alone

28:17.680 --> 28:18.839
to deal with Lianzhou,

28:18.839 --> 28:20.360
I'll be unrighteous.

28:24.839 --> 28:25.920
Anyway,

28:25.920 --> 28:27.319
what flowers

28:27.319 --> 28:28.920
do you want to plant next spring?

28:28.920 --> 28:30.920
I need to start cultivating them now.

28:30.920 --> 28:32.720
Let me know once you've decided.

28:33.279 --> 28:34.440
After doing my things

28:34.440 --> 28:35.720
in the Fragrance Garden,

28:35.720 --> 28:36.799
I'll come over in the evening

28:36.799 --> 28:38.088
to help you with the planting.

28:39.119 --> 28:40.519
All right.

28:40.519 --> 28:42.319
Let me think.

28:42.319 --> 28:43.599
Tomorrow,

28:43.599 --> 28:44.799
Chuanyu will tell you.

28:47.880 --> 28:49.240
Go burn the letter.

28:49.240 --> 28:51.039
What letter? Someone wrote a letter?

28:51.039 --> 28:52.360
How come I didn't know?

28:59.079 --> 29:00.920
What letter? Someone wrote a letter?

29:02.079 --> 29:03.480
He and I were talking about something else.

29:05.319 --> 29:06.839
Your begonias are quite nice.

29:07.359 --> 29:08.839
You move some of them to my courtyard.

29:13.920 --> 29:15.359
I don't think

29:15.359 --> 29:16.599
you match begonias.

29:16.599 --> 29:17.920
You better drop the idea.

29:18.880 --> 29:20.040
Why?

29:21.680 --> 29:23.079
The begonias

29:23.079 --> 29:24.640
mean a secret crush.

29:25.880 --> 29:27.599
Do you have a crush on anyone?

29:39.039 --> 29:40.119
But you've never been

29:40.119 --> 29:41.440
so attached to anyone else.

29:46.248 --> 29:48.840
♫ If the heart is like frost ♫

29:48.840 --> 29:52.666
♫ Congealing so much of the past ♫

29:53.480 --> 29:54.600
Mudan.

29:55.272 --> 29:59.018
♫ Melting and flowing with you ♫

29:59.839 --> 30:01.119
There's something on your nose.

30:01.119 --> 30:05.832
♫ Can this ten thousand miles
of roaming winds and waves ♫

30:05.832 --> 30:07.496
♫ Can it ♫

30:08.559 --> 30:09.960
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

30:16.008 --> 30:20.648
♫ Clouds are hidden by night ♫

30:20.648 --> 30:23.624
♫ Fleecy clouds in the sky ♫

30:23.624 --> 30:26.728
♫ Seeking a place to rest ♫

30:28.629 --> 30:34.696
♫ The moon falls on my shoulder,
a path of dim yellow ♫

30:34.696 --> 30:40.008
♫ Silk grows, sprouting longing ♫

30:40.008 --> 30:42.423
♫ If the heart is like frost ♫

30:42.423 --> 30:46.346
♫ What's the harm in a life of solitude ♫

30:46.346 --> 30:48.712
♫ Yet you shine as light ♫

30:48.712 --> 30:52.584
♫ Piercing through my heart ♫

30:52.584 --> 30:54.952
♫ If love is like frost ♫

30:54.952 --> 30:59.592
♫ There's a flickering candle ♫

30:59.592 --> 31:01.000
♫ No words are said ♫

31:01.000 --> 31:02.856
♫ Yet for you ♫

31:03.601 --> 31:06.281
♫ I'll go ahead ♫

31:06.281 --> 31:07.359
[Liu Mansion]

31:07.359 --> 31:08.759
Stop.

31:08.759 --> 31:11.656
Mr. Liu.

31:12.559 --> 31:13.576
Mr. Liu.

31:14.319 --> 31:16.519
I made a mistake before

31:16.519 --> 31:17.519
and offended you.

31:18.240 --> 31:20.400
I'm truly sorry for that.

31:21.200 --> 31:22.920
I have elderly parents

31:22.920 --> 31:24.680
and children to support.

31:25.599 --> 31:26.960
Please show my mercy.

31:27.640 --> 31:28.640
and spare me.

31:32.359 --> 31:34.079
Prefect Ge.

31:35.039 --> 31:37.119
I don't understand

31:37.119 --> 31:38.599
what you're talking about.

31:39.160 --> 31:40.720
You were punished and lost your position

31:41.319 --> 31:42.759
for the guilt of corruption
and neglect of duty.

31:42.759 --> 31:45.119
That's fair and just.

31:45.119 --> 31:46.880
What does it have to do with me?

31:49.319 --> 31:50.680
Mr. Liu.

31:52.519 --> 31:53.880
Please.

31:53.880 --> 31:55.720
Please spare me.

31:55.720 --> 31:56.720
Give me a chance.

31:57.440 --> 31:59.440
I can do anything

31:59.440 --> 32:00.559
to repay your kindness.

32:03.480 --> 32:05.160
If you think so,

32:06.359 --> 32:09.279
can you drink up the dirty water

32:09.279 --> 32:11.160
from the stable's trough?

32:12.359 --> 32:14.440
From now on, eat and live

32:14.440 --> 32:15.599
in a stable.

32:16.400 --> 32:18.720
If you can do that,

32:18.720 --> 32:19.920
I may recommend you

32:19.920 --> 32:21.519
for a position

32:21.519 --> 32:23.839
as a low-ranking official tending to horses.

32:27.559 --> 32:28.808
Mr. Liu.

32:29.599 --> 32:30.824
Mr. Liu.

32:31.880 --> 32:33.032
Mr. Liu.

32:38.359 --> 32:40.759
It's rare for you to come back.

32:40.759 --> 32:42.319
You even personally cooked.

32:42.319 --> 32:43.496
Thank you.

32:45.240 --> 32:46.359
Well,

32:46.359 --> 32:47.720
if it weren't for my birthday,

32:48.920 --> 32:50.559
I'm afraid he would have forgotten this home.

32:53.240 --> 32:55.079
Father, you're wrong.

32:56.720 --> 32:58.799
I have married into Prince Ning's home.

32:59.359 --> 33:01.079
So I only have Prince Ning's Mansion
as my home.

33:03.279 --> 33:05.319
I can't often come here.

33:07.079 --> 33:08.400
That day,

33:08.400 --> 33:10.119
I didn't abandon you.

33:10.119 --> 33:11.279
When facing an emergency,

33:11.279 --> 33:12.319
I had no choice at all.

33:13.480 --> 33:15.319
Now that you've got married,

33:15.319 --> 33:17.000
can't you stop holding a grudge?

33:18.079 --> 33:19.200
As long as you

33:19.200 --> 33:20.920
please the County Princess,

33:20.920 --> 33:22.400
high-ranking positions

33:22.400 --> 33:23.799
and wealth will come.

33:25.000 --> 33:26.119
Zishu.

33:26.119 --> 33:28.119
Your father has figured out a way.

33:28.119 --> 33:30.079
We will find you two pretty women

33:30.079 --> 33:31.440
and keep them here.

33:31.440 --> 33:33.359
When they bear children,

33:33.359 --> 33:35.079
the children are raised in a remote place.

33:35.920 --> 33:38.319
Even though Prince Ning has immense power,

33:39.079 --> 33:40.880
he will die one day.

33:41.759 --> 33:43.039
After that,

33:43.039 --> 33:44.400
you can come back home

33:44.400 --> 33:45.400
and live with us again.

33:51.240 --> 33:53.000
Don't talk about it again.

33:53.880 --> 33:55.160
Father, mother,

33:56.279 --> 33:57.799
have you ever regarded me as a human

33:57.799 --> 33:59.440
who feels happy

33:59.440 --> 34:01.000
and sad?

34:06.720 --> 34:08.319
We gave birth to you and raised you.

34:08.319 --> 34:09.559
We provided you with good clothes and food.

34:12.039 --> 34:13.239
To survive

34:14.159 --> 34:15.400
and get wealthy,

34:15.400 --> 34:17.239
you gave me to Prince Ning.

34:22.440 --> 34:24.559
When my leg was broken,

34:24.559 --> 34:26.039
where were you?

34:28.000 --> 34:30.480
When I stopped eating in the dungeon
to resist marriage,

34:30.480 --> 34:31.800
where were you then?

34:34.440 --> 34:36.760
When you accepted the dowry from Prince Ning,

34:37.519 --> 34:38.639
I was even less free

34:38.639 --> 34:40.320
than your dog.

34:40.960 --> 34:42.360
Zishu, how could you--

34:43.440 --> 34:47.159
- Zishu.
- What you want is a high-ranking son.

34:47.159 --> 34:49.079
But I don't

34:49.079 --> 34:50.400
want unfeeling

34:50.400 --> 34:51.480
and irresponsible parents.

34:52.280 --> 34:53.679
Liu Shen, are you alright?

34:53.679 --> 34:55.880
You just enjoyed the food.

34:55.880 --> 34:57.519
Guess what you ate?

35:03.719 --> 35:06.000
It was crushed,

35:06.000 --> 35:07.920
just like what you did to me.

35:12.719 --> 35:14.400
You'll never forget this taste,

35:14.400 --> 35:16.079
will you?

35:16.920 --> 35:18.239
Madam.

35:19.280 --> 35:20.800
Madam, wake up.

35:21.440 --> 35:22.888
Knock.

35:22.888 --> 35:23.976
Madam.

35:36.000 --> 35:37.800
You are already the owner of a garden

35:37.800 --> 35:39.199
and two shops.

35:39.960 --> 35:41.519
Why are you tending to the fields
and weeding personally?

35:42.760 --> 35:44.008
Take a break.

36:02.920 --> 36:04.360
You know what?

36:04.360 --> 36:05.679
I am from Luoyang.

36:06.559 --> 36:08.760
But when my mother was pregnant with me

36:08.760 --> 36:09.920
and came to Chang'an to visit relatives,

36:10.840 --> 36:11.880
she gave birth to me prematurely.

36:13.079 --> 36:14.280
I was born in Fragrance Garden.

36:15.880 --> 36:17.280
I never heard of it.

36:18.960 --> 36:20.520
It is fate.

36:21.519 --> 36:22.800
In my childhood, my mother often

36:22.800 --> 36:24.280
took me to Chang'an to visit relatives.

36:26.280 --> 36:27.800
We spent a long time

36:27.800 --> 36:29.280
in this garden.

36:30.480 --> 36:31.800
Back then,

36:31.800 --> 36:33.920
all the peonies in this garden

36:33.920 --> 36:35.960
were cultivated by my mother and me together.

36:37.320 --> 36:38.880
And this tree as well.

36:48.000 --> 36:49.400
Later on,

36:49.400 --> 36:50.880
my father's business grew larger

36:51.960 --> 36:53.679
and my parents got busy.

36:53.679 --> 36:55.280
Moreover, my grandmother died.

36:56.559 --> 36:57.800
So we did not often come here.

37:01.199 --> 37:02.920
The child grows up

37:02.920 --> 37:04.000
as the parents age.

37:04.800 --> 37:06.360
It seems to happen in an instant.

37:09.360 --> 37:10.639
Since my mother died,

37:12.800 --> 37:14.088
everything has changed.

37:17.679 --> 37:19.119
Fortunately, this tree is still here,

37:19.920 --> 37:20.968
isn't it?

37:26.800 --> 37:27.920
When it was planted,

37:27.920 --> 37:29.239
it was not even half as tall as me.

37:29.760 --> 37:30.880
But now,

37:30.880 --> 37:31.880
it's thriving.

37:36.599 --> 37:37.960
You are doing well now.

37:39.480 --> 37:40.760
Your mother will be happy

37:41.760 --> 37:42.880
about it.

37:48.800 --> 37:50.400
Well, anyway,

37:50.920 --> 37:52.280
tonight let me help you

37:52.800 --> 37:54.152
hoe the soil.

37:59.199 --> 38:00.639
Have you ever done that?

38:00.639 --> 38:01.840
Do you know how to use a hoe?

38:01.840 --> 38:03.039
Don't underestimate me.

38:03.039 --> 38:04.360
What's so hard about hoeing?

38:06.440 --> 38:08.079
Alright, show me.

38:14.639 --> 38:16.008
You're pretty strong.

38:24.480 --> 38:25.519
What did you hit?

38:36.079 --> 38:37.224
What's that?

38:56.920 --> 38:58.248
Be careful.

39:01.440 --> 39:03.280
May my daughter Weifang

39:03.800 --> 39:05.639
have a good husband

39:05.639 --> 39:07.280
and be happy.

39:11.159 --> 39:12.199
My mother did it.

39:15.320 --> 39:16.800
She buried it for me.

39:28.840 --> 39:29.920
My mother said

39:31.880 --> 39:32.920
my grandmother

39:33.440 --> 39:34.800
buried a jar of wine

39:36.280 --> 39:38.480
in the Fragrance Garden for her at her birth.

39:41.400 --> 39:43.599
I never expected my mother
to have buried one for me too.

39:46.000 --> 39:47.239
I think she wanted

39:49.559 --> 39:51.239
to drink it with me

39:52.719 --> 39:54.159
when I got married.

39:57.320 --> 39:58.824
Sadly…

40:13.679 --> 40:15.440
Don't be sad.

40:15.440 --> 40:17.159
We've just gotten married.

40:17.159 --> 40:18.440
We found this wine at the right time.

40:20.599 --> 40:21.599
So,

40:22.320 --> 40:24.280
your mother is watching.

40:25.239 --> 40:26.320
She let me, her son-in-law,

40:26.320 --> 40:27.320
dig up the wine.

40:33.840 --> 40:35.432
Son-in-law?

40:36.360 --> 40:38.280
What cheek.

40:39.440 --> 40:40.679
Anyway,

40:41.280 --> 40:42.800
we have to

40:42.800 --> 40:43.960
drink this wine.

40:50.559 --> 40:52.800
It's leaking.

40:52.800 --> 40:55.239
No, we can't waste it.

40:55.960 --> 40:57.440
Get a bowl.

41:02.519 --> 41:03.920
Here it is.

41:03.920 --> 41:05.360
Easy, pour it slowly.

41:05.360 --> 41:06.504
Don't waste it.

41:07.960 --> 41:09.000
Let me give you some.

41:12.599 --> 41:13.599
Is it still leaking?

41:14.159 --> 41:15.239
Pour it carefully.

41:15.239 --> 41:16.680
Don't…

41:17.559 --> 41:18.760
I'm drinking like this.

41:21.800 --> 41:23.159
My mother left this wine for me.

41:23.159 --> 41:24.760
You can't drink it all. Give it back to me.

41:24.760 --> 41:26.280
Isn't it a wedding wine?

41:26.280 --> 41:28.199
Give it back to me.

41:28.199 --> 41:30.000
The bride can't drink it alone.

41:31.719 --> 41:32.719
Give it back to me.

41:33.280 --> 41:34.920
Don't drink it all.

41:34.920 --> 41:36.039
Don't drink it up.

41:37.280 --> 41:39.320
Give it back to me. I'm serious.

41:39.320 --> 41:41.000
My mother left it for me. Don't drink it all.

41:41.000 --> 41:42.440
- Okay.
- Be careful not to spill it.

41:42.440 --> 41:43.880
Put it here.

42:02.622 --> 42:08.896
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

42:10.750 --> 42:17.434
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

42:18.110 --> 42:25.308
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

42:26.302 --> 42:34.654
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

42:34.654 --> 42:42.197
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

42:42.851 --> 42:51.038
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

42:51.038 --> 42:58.849
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

42:59.454 --> 43:06.746
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

43:27.422 --> 43:34.305
♫ The distant night sky strewn with stars,
reflecting the lovely moon ♫

43:35.606 --> 43:42.300
♫ The peony's magnificent beauty
fills the Fragrance Garden ♫

43:43.057 --> 43:50.359
♫ With a heart as my lantern,
I don't mind the distant mountain paths ♫

43:51.043 --> 43:59.352
♫ The flute's sound,
a fleeting life's wishes fulfilled ♫

43:59.352 --> 44:06.783
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

44:07.614 --> 44:15.870
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

44:15.870 --> 44:23.294
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

44:24.298 --> 44:31.748
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫
